[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:85. Paris in the Spring]
[00:00.780]Lesson 85. | 第85课。
[00:03.355]Hello, Ken. | 你好,肯。
[00:05.645]Hello, George. | 你好,乔治。
[00:07.150]Have you just been to the cinema? | 你刚去过电影院吗?
[00:09.250]Yes, I have. | 是的,我去过。
[00:10.305]What's on? | 正在放映什么电影?
[00:11.480]Paris in the spring. | 巴黎之春。
[00:13.145]Oh, I've already seen it. | 哦,我看过了。
[00:15.295]I saw it on a BBC television programme last year. | 我去年在BBC的一个电视节目上看过。
[00:19.315]It's an old film but it's very good. | 这是一部老电影,但非常好看。
[00:22.250]Paris is a beautiful city. | 巴黎是一个美丽的城市。
[00:24.495]I have never been there. | 我从未去过那里。
[00:26.540]Have you ever been there, Ken? | 你去过那里吗,肯?
[00:28.625]Yes, I have. | 是的,我去过。
[00:29.980]I was there in April. | 我四月去过那里。
[00:31.750]Paris in the spring, eh? | 巴黎之春,是吗?
[00:33.970]It was spring, but the weather was awful. | 是春天,但天气很糟糕。
[00:36.835]It rained all the time. | 一直在下雨。
[00:39.045]Just like dear old London. | 就像亲爱的老伦敦一样。